Plan, coordinate, and implement University-wide marketing and engagement campaigns and programmes;
Ensure effective and accurate communication the University’s achievements, developments, and initiatives across diverse media platforms and promotional channels;
Oversee the end-to-end planning and production of promotional materials, including videos, graphics and publications;
Connect and collaborate closely with internal Faculties/Departments/Offices to identify and leverage the University’s latest news and developments for marketing initiatives; and
Perform any other duties as assigned.
