At least 8 years of relevant experience in Marketing, Public Relations, Media Management, or related areas;
Established networks and connections with Chinese Mainland and international media, as well as universities;
Excellent written and spoken English and Chinese, including Putonghua;
Strong management, interpersonal, communication, and organisational skills;
Effective team player, with the ability to multitask, work well under pressure, and meet tight deadlines; and
Proficient computer skills.
