Manage and execute photo shooting, video filming, and live streaming for university events, including setup and operation of relevant equipment, ensuring high-quality production and reliable content delivery;
Execute and edit high-quality photo and video content for marketing use, including profiles, event coverage, and promotional materials;
Design compelling graphics, illustrations, and visual assets using the Adobe Creative Cloud suite;
