At least 8 years of relevant work experience in multimedia content creation, including photography role; familiarity with the higher education sector is an advantage;
Proficient in Adobe Creative Cloud applications including Photoshop, Premiere Pro, and After Effects, as well as AI tools;
Proven photo shooting, video filming, editing, and motion graphics skills;
Familiarity with live streaming platforms and equipment;
Strong data analysis and problem-solving abilities;
Creative mindset with an eye for visual design; and
Excellent interpersonal, time management, organisational, and multitasking skills.
