a bachelor’s degree in healthcare-related discipline, health informatics or computer studies.
experience in manging and coordinating projects;
Familiarity with AI applications in healthcare or education settings (preferred);
Working experience in nursing institution, proficiency in multi-media skills, 3D printing technology or virtual reality technology (preferred);
