Information Technology Manager (Workflow and RPA) (26270155)
The Information Technology Manager will be a key member of the Applications & Integration Services Section within the Office of Information Technology, reporting directly to the Senior Information Technology Manager. This role is pivotal in driving the university’s digital transformation by leading the development and management of workflow automation with RPA solutions across various university functions to enhance operational efficiency and productivity.
