An AI enthusiast, has good knowledge and experience in utilising AI tools to solve problems;
Experience in social media management, liaison with external stakeholders, and coordination of resources to support programme promotion and student engagement;
Proficient in written and spoken English and Chinese (including Cantonese and Putonghua);
Strong sense of ownership and be flexible with competing priorities and changes;
Meticulousness, good interpersonal and problem-solving skills, attention to detail and a strong sense of responsibility;
Self-motivated with the ability to work both independently and collaboratively within a team; and
Willingness to work on weekends and outside office hours when required.
