Ref No.: REG/ASO/03/26
Major Duties:
The appointee shall:
(a) Perform administrative duties and coordination work in one or more of the following areas:
(i) Student admissions, student visa applications, administration and support services for both local and / or non-local (including Chinese Mainland) students, assessment of academic qualifications, programme registration, and student record management;
(ii) Coordination of student support services, including examination scheduling and invigilation, processing of assessment results, issuance of transcripts and certificates, and certificate verification;
(iii) Promotion of undergraduate and postgraduate degree programmes and admission requirements / processes at education expos and to education agents and collaboration partners;
(iv) Liaison with internal and external units, including applicants, education agents, and education institutions on student admission matters;
(v) Collection and refund of tuition and related fees, and administration of the Government’s subsidy schemes; and
(vi) Various system setups, implementation and enhancements.
(b) Prepare statistics and compile reports relevant to admissions, enrolment, student feedback evaluation, and academic performance for programme planning and accreditation exercises;
